<title>POLAND: OKOCIM PLANS NO 1996 PAYOUT.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM PLANS NO 1996 PAYOUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Okocim SA does not plan a 1996 dividend and wants to earmark its last year's profit mainly for reserve capital, the company said in a Tuesday statement.</p>
<p>Okocim said 26.8 million zlotys of its net profit would be earmarked for reserve capital and 300,000 zlotys for the firm's social fund.</p>
<p>The managements proposal will be voted on the general shareholders meeting on April 25.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
